{
 "_doc": "Balor, boss (GAME_DESIGN.md: The Misty Isles bosses; art 10/31/2026). Built by tools/art/build_boss_balor.py; rules in docs/ART_RULES.md. From Cath Maige Tuired (The Second Battle of Mag Tuired): the old Fomorian king with the destroying eye, which was never opened except on the battlefield, when four men lifted its lid with a polished handle passed through it, and any host that looked on it was overcome, until Lugh's sling-stone drove the eye out through his head. A huge, grim old giant: one great eye under a heavy lid, the handle through the lid, the eye glowing; long dark hair and beard; a dark mantle, a studded leather war-belt and kilt. As big as Kronos and Surtr.",
